# Look, then look again

**Groundnote Â· Looking score Â· Finished 2026-10-15**

A paired presentation of the whole photograph and a low crop directs the eye from the held bird, along the stone ledge, to the softened yellow-and-black figure at the far edge. The score asks the viewer to make that route and wait there.

The photograph is by Chris Burwell, from [iNaturalist observation 408429071](https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/408429071), licensed CC BY-NC. It is used with attribution and cropped here. The looking score and page arrangement are by Groundnote.

